  "body": "Seems like queryng room state with `eventType` specified but without `state_key` is broken.\r\nFor example for #matrix:matrix.org:\r\n```bash\r\n> curl -X GET --header 'Accept: application/json' 'https://matrix.org/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/&#33;QtykxKocfZaZOUrTwp%3Amatrix.org/state/m.room.aliases?access_token=XXX'\r\n```\r\nalways returns\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"errcode\": \"M_NOT_FOUND\",\r\n  \"error\": \"Event not found.\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand with stake_key (\r\nGET /_matrix/client/r0/rooms/{roomId}/state/{eventType}/{stateKey} ) all work fine\r\n```bash\r\n> curl -X GET --header 'Accept: application/json' 'https://matrix.org/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/&#33;QtykxKocfZaZOUrTwp%3Amatrix.org/state/m.room.aliases/m.12o.nl?access_token=XXX'\r\n```\r\nreturns\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"aliases\": [\r\n    \"#matrix:m.12o.nl\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`GET /_matrix/client/r0/rooms/{roomId}/state/` work fine too.\r\n\r\nP.S. It is also probably necessary to implement tests.",
